@stevenmarkryan I cannot believe how new Grok Bot is and how integrated it already is in not only my businesses but my personal life.

2027 is going to be life-changing for anyone actually using this technology. 

I feel bad for those on the sidelines or with their head in the sand.

@anabology A Tesla is a conscious car. 

Of course, there is a limit to how much consciousness you want in a car. Or is there? 

Especially if it can access the Internet, the car has far more freedom of action than a GPU in a data center.

@BLKMDL3 @wholemars In case anyone is curious:

We’ve had a ~pixel-perfect world model since last year, which is critical for synthetic data generation. 

The (much) smaller version of that in the car is a conditional mean-flow model, based on the recent sequence of Tesla Universal Vision Encoder
